WEBVTT

00:03:59.468 --> 00:04:11.772
(Inaudible echoing voice)

00:04:11.772 --> 00:04:13.589
Not so good, is it?

00:04:13.589 --> 00:04:18.048
If you take that 1.2 seconds down to 0.4 seconds

00:04:18.048 --> 00:04:20.996
by installing acoustic treatments, sound absorbing materials

00:04:20.996 --> 00:04:23.704
and so forth, this is what you get.

00:04:23.704 --> 00:04:27.565
